WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.000 line:100%,end
The driver points at the machine’s QR code.
The phone’s browser opens this machine’s page.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:28.000 line:100%,end
The browser opens from the QR code.
An email code is asked only on a new phone.
Type the email and press Sign in with email code.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:42.000 line:100%,end
Next time, press Sign in with fingerprint.
The phone asks for the fingerprint, and the machine view opens.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:56.000 line:100%,end
After sign-in you see the machine view.
From there you enter readings or report a defect.
